			for ; i < len(accepted) && i < len(offer); i++ {
				if accepted[i] == '*' || offer[i] == '*' {
					return offer
				}
				if accepted[i] != offer[i] {
					break
				}
			}
			if i == len(accepted) {
				return offer
			}
```
Change nothing else in the file.

STEP 3 (verify): `cd /gin && gofmt -l context.go` (nothing), `go build ./...`, and `cd /gin && go test -count=1 -run 'TestContextNegotiation' -v ./ 2>&1 | tail -40` — ALL existing negotiation tests must still pass (TestContextNegotiationFormat, ...FormatWithAccept, ...FormatWithWildcardAccept, ...FormatCustom, ...WithJSON/XML/HTML, ...NotSupport). Then run the full suite `cd /gin && go test -count=1 ./... 2>&1 | tail -20`. Then re-run your temp probe test to confirm no panic and report the new table. Then DELETE /gin/zz_tmp_neg_test.go and confirm `cd /gin && git status --porcelain` shows only errors.go, response_writer.go, context.go, utils.go (no temp files).

Report: the probe tables (before/after), the exact diff, and all test outputs.
